    "text": "WWMT\nwebsite\nKalamazoo\nFight between family of suspect, family of man he's accused of killing ends in arrests\nBy Ivy S. FowlerAutumn Pitchure,\n1 days agoKALAMAZOO, Mich. — A fight between two families led to several arrests and a heavy police presence Tuesday. Several Kalamazoo Department of Public Safety (KDPS) officers and Kalamazoo County Sheriff's Office (KCSO) deputies responded to the Pratt Court House around 10 a.m. after a fight broke out on the ground floor between family members of Richard Lee Rogers Jr., a murder suspect, and family members of Xzavier D. Harris, the man he's accused of killing.\n26",
